  ($q$conv-520$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Standard English Conventions$q$, $q$Boundaries$q$, 1, $q$Octopuses have three hearts______and two of them pump blood to the gills.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text so that it conforms to the conventions of Standard English?$q$, $q$[", ",": ","; "," "]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$A coordinating conjunction ("and") joining two independent clauses must be preceded by a comma.$q$, null),
