  ($q$alg-80$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Linear equations in one variable$q$, 2, null, $q$If -(x + 3) + 11 = −2(x − 8) + 5, what is the value of 3x − 4?$q$, $q$["37","−35","13","35"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$Expand both sides: −x − 3 + 11 = −2x + 16 + 5. Collecting terms gives (1)x = 13, so x = 13. Then 3x − 4 = 3(13) − 4 = 35.$q$, null),
